# CLAUDE.md is ignored machine-wide by ~/.gitignore_global. Un-ignore it HERE only:
# it is this project's engineering constitution and 14 references across README.md,
# the ADRs and the plans point at its sections. Without this line every one of those
# dangles for anyone who clones the repository. Scoped deliberately — the global rule
# still protects CLAUDE.md in every other repo on this machine.
!CLAUDE.md
